{2}╭───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮{R}
{2}│{R}{1}⦿ Browse and manage otter images from the registry         {R}{2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Usage:{R}                                                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter reg        <list|pull|remove> [options]{R}            {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter registry   <list|pull|remove> [options]{R}            {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Examples:{R}                                                {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter reg ls --all{R}                                       {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter registry list{R}                                      {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter reg pull --all --force{R}                             {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}otter registry remove alpine,fedora{R}                      {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ List / Ls:{R}                                               {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}Examples: otter reg ls [options] or otter registry list{R}  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--all{R}     {2}┆{R} {4}-a{R}  {5}Include disabled images{R}                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--json{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-j{R}  {5}Output as JSON{R}                            {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Pull / Pl:{R}                                               {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}Examples: otter reg pl [options] or otter registry pull{R}  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--all{R}     {2}┆{R} {4}-a{R}  {5}Pull all missing enabled images{R}           {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--force{R}   {2}┆{R} {4}-f{R}  {5}Force the operation{R}                       {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Remove / Rm:{R}                                             {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}  {5}Examples: otter reg rm [options] or otter registry remove{R}{2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--all{R}     {2}┆{R} {4}-a{R}  {5}Remove all cached images{R}                  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--force{R}   {2}┆{R} {4}-f{R}  {5}Force the operation{R}                       {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Extras:{R}                                                  {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--root{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-r{R}  {5}Use rootful containers{R}                    {2}│{R}
{2}│{R} {4}--help{R}    {2}┆{R} {4}-h{R}  {5}Show this help message{R}                    {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ Notes:{R}                                                   {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}Reliable disabled images use vendor fallbacks.{R}             {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}Unreliable ones are reported as unavailable.{R}               {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}Disabled images are hidden unless --all is used.{R}           {2}│{R}
{2}├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤{R}
{2}│{R}{3}▸ See also:{R}                                                {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}See Registry in otter documentation.{R}                       {2}│{R}
{2}│{R}{5}See Images in otter documentation.{R}                         {2}│{R}
